Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.06,0:03:03.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予你这家伙的伤害是2000！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.51,0:03:06.29,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌闪光雨！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:23.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马…为什么你要一个人战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.97,0:03:27.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们不是一心同体的吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.56,0:03:29.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.76,0:03:34.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟…。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:45.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.43,0:03:49.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是你拿着皇之钥吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.84,0:03:50.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.53,0:03:53.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马和巴利安{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.20,0:03:55.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}开始了赌上 No.的战斗。
