Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.63,0:04:00.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}把我带到游马那里去。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.79,0:04:01.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是…。
