Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.86,0:04:06.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些想要夺走星光体的家伙来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:07.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哎？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.18,0:04:13.24,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟能帮我拿着这个吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.55,0:04:15.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}可是 没有星光体的话霍普就……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.50,0:04:19.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我不会把星光体交给任何人。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.70,0:04:21.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}能保护那家伙的只有我。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:24.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体 游马他一定
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.45,0:04:26.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是想保护你。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.58,0:04:27.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以把钥匙交给我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.41,0:04:29.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马他？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.29,0:04:33.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是吗 游马是想保护我……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.13,0:04:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.42,0:04:37.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟 游马现在{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.93,0:04:40.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}正独自一人与新的威胁战斗着。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.03,0:04:42.95,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我也必须一同战斗。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:46.34,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望你能把我送到游马身边。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:49.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.27,0:04:52.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……。
