Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.62,0:06:37.35,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.90,0:06:39.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.63,0:06:50.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.78,0:07:17.41,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.39,0:07:27.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你这家伙 是天城快斗吧。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.63,0:07:31.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给我下地狱去吧为了巴利安世界！
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.46,0:07:34.15,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）地狱的话 迟早会去的。
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.49,0:07:36.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我那罪孽深重的灵魂的归宿。
