Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.97,0:08:01.03,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就让我火大！
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.20,0:08:02.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）决斗！
