Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.22,0:09:48.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 机装魔人 天使将军！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.20,0:09:49.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}直接攻击！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.79,0:09:53.32,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动陷阱精准点防御！
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.91,0:09:56.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在对方攻击过来时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
