Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.97,0:10:04.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}拜托了 隆隆隆巨灵！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.52,0:10:07.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}末日空袭！
