Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.42,0:10:23.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}超量·陨石。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.52,0:10:27.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合 自己的超量怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.92,0:10:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击守备怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.13,0:10:32.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}如果攻击力超过了那个守备力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.91,0:10:35.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就按那个差值给对手造成战斗伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.28,0:10:43.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.13,0:10:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.87,0:10:51.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}啧 勉强撑住了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.34,0:10:54.21,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我要发动超量·陨石的
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.21,0:10:55.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}另一个效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:57.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}受到这个效果的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.68,0:10:59.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}破坏对手怪兽时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.88,0:11:02.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}抽1张卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.32,0:11:07.54,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后我盖上两张卡回合结束。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.38,0:11:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《说什么为了保护星光体而战斗{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.45,0:11:19.31,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞什么啊 这算
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.50,0:11:22.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到头来 一个人什么都……》
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.50,0:11:23.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（小鸟）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.44,0:11:27.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.26,0:11:30.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}小鸟。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.06,0:11:32.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}接住！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.15,0:11:44.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那是！？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.61,0:11:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.94,0:11:48.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.83,0:11:52.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}决斗还没结束就撑不住了吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.15,0:11:53.83,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.34,0:12:03.55,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星……星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.50,0:12:05.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.79,0:12:09.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我必须保护你。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.69,0:12:33.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体……。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.59,0:12:37.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}终于出现了吗 星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.52,0:12:39.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体…
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.99,0:12:42.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你为什么来啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.29,0:12:46.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算没有你我一个人也…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.19,0:12:49.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 为什么要这么乱来。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:51.82,0:12:54.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我看到了啊 那个梦…。
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.17,0:12:55.61,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}梦？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.02,0:12:58.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我在梦里听到了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.75,0:13:03.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}说我会失去 重要的东西。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.64,0:13:07.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那一定 不只是一个梦。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.67,0:13:09.89,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}所以 我…。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.67,0:13:13.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}对不起啊 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.08,0:13:14.57,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}变得这么 透明了。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.43,0:13:17.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我 没能保护好你。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.36,0:13:21.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马 我 以你为傲。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.29,0:13:26.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我这副身体是交到了真正朋友的证明。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.59,0:13:32.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}为了我而受伤为了我而战斗的朋友。
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.57,0:13:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}伤害我朋友的人{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.51,0:13:41.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我绝不原谅！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.80,0:13:49.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}站起来！游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.88,0:13:53.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.09,0:14:03.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的生命值还没有耗尽呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.17,0:14:06.75,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还是老样子，一副高高在上的口气啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.27,0:14:08.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，站起来！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.21,0:14:10.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你要瘫到什么时候啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.27,0:14:14.11,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是的！一个个都
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.11,0:14:16.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}想说什么就说什么！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.44,0:14:18.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}来吧，站起来！站起来啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.30,0:14:27.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天啊，我！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.99,0:14:36.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊！游马！星光体！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.20,0:14:42.09,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}真是一群让人无语的家伙！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:42.09,0:14:44.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}都那种状态了，还有干劲吗。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:46.37,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，那是？
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.86,0:14:47.38,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那个啊！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.94,0:14:49.58,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}连 No.卡都能破坏掉
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.58,0:14:52.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}是异晶人的新兵器，叫混沌超量那玩意儿。
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.53,0:14:54.86,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量……
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.82,0:14:57.96,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有意思，要赢啊，游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.59,0:15:01.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}已经胜利的方程式都凑齐了。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.32,0:15:04.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我的回合，抽卡！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.11,0:15:07.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}蠢货！就剩区区100的生命值
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.59,0:15:09.07,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}还想继续打吗！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.41,0:15:11.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马，召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.28,0:15:16.08,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我召唤我我我魔术师！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.57,0:15:19.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（我我我魔术师）哼，我我我！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.56,0:15:22.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再从手牌发动魔法卡。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.53,0:15:25.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！我发动魔法卡
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.63,0:15:27.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}No.召唤！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.80,0:15:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是把自己场上的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.00,0:15:33.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}魔法师族怪兽解放{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.59,0:15:36.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}特殊召唤墓地里的 No.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.73,0:15:47.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}复活吧，希望皇霍普！
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.94,0:15:57.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没用的，你根本打不倒混沌超量。
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.87,0:15:59.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动永续陷阱
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.30,0:16:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}发动 超量·地狱牢笼！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.34,0:16:04.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在 对方场上{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.17,0:16:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}有怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.30,0:16:06.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被特殊召唤时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.95,0:16:08.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}封印那只怪兽的攻击
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.91,0:16:11.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}每当对方的回合结束时{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.48,0:16:13.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}给予500点伤害。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.86,0:16:14.48,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么！？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.32,0:16:17.28,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来 霍普的攻击就被封印了。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.62,0:16:20.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}而且 你这家伙的生命值 只剩100！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.57,0:16:24.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个回合结束时你的生命值注定耗尽。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.15,0:16:26.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我怎么可能让你得逞！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.28,0:16:29.65,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我和星光体的力量合为一体
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.65,0:16:31.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我们的可能性就是无限的！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.24,0:16:33.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上吧 游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.64,0:16:34.06,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}哦！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.94,0:16:36.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.20,0:16:41.49,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇霍普 超量混沌 变身！
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.94,0:16:54.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将混沌化为光明的使者。
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.11,0:16:58.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现身吧 CNo.39。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.30,0:17:02.23,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}希望皇 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.42,0:17:14.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（两人）太好了 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.99,0:17:16.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）上啊 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:19.59,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我发动 霍普雷的效果！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.21,0:17:22.39,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}使用一个叠放单元
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.39,0:17:25.05,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力提升500点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.65,0:17:26.98,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}叠放充能！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.14,0:17:30.47,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}然后将对方怪兽的攻击力{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.62,0:17:31.74,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}下降1000点。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.60,0:17:34.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}上啊 霍普雷！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.60,0:17:38.13,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.61,0:17:42.88,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}混沌超量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.88,0:17:45.53,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能会被 No.击败。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.99,0:17:48.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}陷阱发动 狂野充电器！
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.52,0:17:51.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡是 在没有叠放单元{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.56,0:17:52.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己的怪兽超量
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.81,0:17:53.71,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被攻击的时候{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.08,0:17:56.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽的攻击力
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.14,0:17:58.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到我怪兽身上。
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.16,0:18:02.84,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这样一来，天使将军的攻击力就是4600了。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.04,0:18:07.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力又被反超了！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.73,0:18:09.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}再这样下去，游马他。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.94,0:18:13.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}到此为止了，九十九游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:14.60,0:18:15.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}让你见识见识。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.30,0:18:16.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我和。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.29,0:18:18.46,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}我的力量！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.06,0:18:21.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}速攻魔法，No.冲击！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.16,0:18:23.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这张卡在
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.91,0:18:25.79,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}自己场上的 No.怪兽{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.79,0:18:28.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}与攻击力高出1000以上的怪兽
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.20,0:18:29.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}进行战斗时发动{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.61,0:18:33.27,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}将对方怪兽攻击力的数值{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.27,0:18:34.93,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}加到自己 No.怪兽的
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.93,0:18:36.12,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}攻击力上。
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.27,0:18:41.44,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎么可能。攻击力7600！
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.74,0:18:45.64,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}最后一击！霍普剑 混沌斩！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:12.24,0:19:13.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马赢了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.97,0:19:14.81,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.44,0:19:16.97,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}赢了 赢了耶！
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.18,0:19:20.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}太好了 游马 星光体。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.11,0:19:42.56,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}你以为这样就结束了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.05,0:19:45.77,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没忘吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.05,0:19:49.92,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界的军团正在朝这里赶来。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.33,0:19:52.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}马上就要 到这里了。
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.91,0:19:59.87,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗／鲨鱼）那可不好说？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.85,0:20:06.66,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}那些家伙们…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.82,0:20:09.42,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗！ 鲨鱼！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.28,0:20:12.91,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}很遗憾 你的同伴不会来了。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.83,0:20:17.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}现在这个时候 你的同伴们正舒舒服服地在梦里呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.31,0:20:19.94,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不可能…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.38,0:20:25.04,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就凭两个人就把那支军团打败了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.02,0:20:37.82,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}怎 怎么会…。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.73,0:20:39.99,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要有我们在……。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.49,0:20:43.45,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}这个世界的就休想任你们为所欲为！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.15,0:20:45.33,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（轨道7）直接攻击。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.09,0:20:52.02,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}搞定收工！
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.02,0:20:59.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}《原来如此。
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.54,0:21:02.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}没想到居然被全部翻盘了。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.65,0:21:05.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}不过 好戏才刚开始呢。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.67,0:21:09.76,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}九十九游马 天城快斗 神代凌牙》
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.39,0:21:15.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来他果然也和菲卡博士一样{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.89,0:21:19.85,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}被巴利安操控了意识是这么回事啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.68,0:21:21.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安……。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.89,0:21:23.22,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西她们）游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.21,0:21:26.67,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（铁男）干得漂亮 游马！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.82,0:21:28.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（凯西）达令 好帅！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.81,0:21:31.62,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嘿嘿！ 碰上我 巴利安什么的。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.80,0:21:34.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}什么的…… 算什么呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.93,0:21:36.43,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}（快斗）游马。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.98,0:21:40.36,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}看来终于正式行动了啊。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.91,0:21:42.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}巴利安世界的刺客们。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.59,0:21:45.14,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}快斗 鲨鱼。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.90,0:21:47.25,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}战斗 现在才要开始。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.07,0:21:50.78,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}嗯！不管来什么样的家伙{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC}→
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.22,0:21:54.01,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}只要我们齐心协力就绝对不会输。
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.62,0:21:56.63,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}就算成群结队放马过来吧！
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.41,0:22:00.51,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}一飞冲天吧 我！
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.65,0:23:42.68,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
Dialogue: 0,0:23:43.08,0:23:46.17,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\fnZCOOL KuaiLe}
